# Agentic Workflow (minimal)

- Domain facts: `AGENTS.md`. Do **not** bulk-read `.cursor/skills/**`.
- Simple chat/hotfix: implement directly with scoped `@` files; skip plan unless asked.
- Feature / protected work: use `/plan-feature` or `/dev-module`, then workers + `/workflow-eval`.
- Protected paths (`.cursor/config/protected-paths.json`): need current `docs/plans/*` + `docs/reviews/*`, or logged `review-override.sh --skip-review "reason"`.
- Skills: run `skill-loader.py` only for the active phase; read matched `SKILL.md` only; open references one-at-a-time.
